"smart_blocks:Computer Science/JavaScript/JavaScript Transpilers (e.g., Babel) and Polyfills - Overview.md#BBFABBA6;\">browser and environment compatibility in JavaScript. They enable developers to use modern JavaScript features while ensuring their code works across different browsers and JavaScript engines, including older ones that don't support newer language features. </mark>This is crucial in web development because users access websites using various browsers with different levels of JavaScript support.": {"path":null,"embeddings":{"TaylorAI/bge-micro-v2":{"vec":[-0.05601295,-0.01921583,0.02308408,-0.02738574,-0.01640231,-0.00619357,-0.0444006,0.00836174,-0.04326874,-0.04644755,-0.05633738,0.00150006,0.00602261,0.02135484,0.04303633,0.10158983,-0.0288741,0.0231069,-0.03795926,-0.01041232,0.09254882,0.01706056,0.01356145,-0.04019221,-0.06084424,0.08102325,-0.02614207,-0.01159352,0.0129513,-0.10669277,-0.01664601,-0.08364699,-0.03764541,0.01049578,-0.01240233,-0.04490739,0.00395706,0.03469552,-0.02516366,0.01337295,-0.01112614,0.01324614,-0.03168144,-0.01305708,-0.07278812,-0.0417492,-0.05072269,0.0062059,-0.04846704,-0.01437192,-0.0330252,-0.01584606,-0.0326783,0.0046459,-0.00060493,0.00480104,0.02007732,0.06678469,0.00166954,0.00862846,0.05429862,0.03601235,-0.13717653,0.10434169,0.06993645,0.04275807,-0.0215044,-0.05059559,0.02835448,0.02645255,-0.10631499,0.02588303,0.00834208,0.01301393,0.0076722,-0.01721188,0.00907981,-0.06614183,-0.00713749,0.00906396,0.01397375,-0.04592209,-0.01504557,-0.05343294,0.01839227,0.00917485,0.03907197,-0.02767698,0.05546497,0.00981406,-0.02560022,-0.06750454,0.04524002,0.01540957,-0.03264597,-0.00227524,0.05777919,-0.03347524,0.00755982,0.14171836,-0.07040591,0.01154134,0.05043083,-0.06290557,0.03938514,-0.01836068,-0.0091895,-0.00106404,0.02186859,-0.03812847,-0.06020205,-0.02759532,0.00951838,0.01249142,-0.04794994,-0.05681184,-0.02280437,-0.03314715,0.05855782,-0.00055031,0.03992962,0.03650254,0.06188891,0.03565619,0.06011